message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "die_another_day: ICARUS — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  PROJECT BOND film package for Die Another Day (2002), mission codename ICARUS.
  Implements six deterministic domain concepts as pure modules behind a frozen
  BOND-API MissionProvider: biometric identity-replacement detection, DNA
  sequence identity verification, ice-palace thermal operations, cold-water
  immersion risk, ice-structure integrity, and orbital-mirror targeting.
authors:
